source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The same holds for `bq.` with no space after the `.`: Jira renders the quote inside the cell and jiro keeps the text with a warning.
-- input.jira --
||h||
|bq.y|
-- rendered.html --
<div class='table-wrap'>
<table class='confluenceTable'><tbody>
<tr>
<th class='confluenceTh'>h</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class='confluenceTd'><blockquote><p>y</p></blockquote></td>
</tr>
</tbody></table>
</div>
-- want.md --
| h |
| --- |
| bq.y |
-- warnings.json --
[
  {
    "Line": 2,
    "Column": 2,
    "Construct": "table",
    "Reason": "Jira renders a block quote inside this table cell; JFM keeps its text"
  }
]
